# Bob's Woodworking Application (AWS Implementation)

This project code required to deploy and run a Bob's Woodworking application
supported by AWS.

## Quick Start

## Requirements outside of this Repository

1. Add AWS Credentials to GitHub
2. Create Terraform State Bucket
3. Create Terrafrom State Lock Table
4. Create App Role + Policies

## Build Layer zip file

docker build -f layers/Dockerfile.{replace-w-file_name} -t {replace-w-layer-name} .
docker run --rm -v /Users/antoniod621/Documents/Coding/bobs-woodworking/bobs-woodworing-backend/layers/output:/output {replace-w-layer-name}

docker build -f layers/Dockerfile.utils -t utils-layer .
